OL,3,GNEWSAIVF funding may be revisited, says
OL,4,Ahealth official
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States of Guernsey has said it is
OL,7,F"not ruling out revisiting" public
OL,8,Ffunding for in vitro fertilisation
OL,9,F(IVF) treatment.
OL,11,FIn 2002 the States decided IVF would
OL,12,Fnot be publicly funded, meaning people
OL,13,Fhave to travel off the island for
OL,14,Ftreatment.
OL,16,FPresident of Health and Social Care
OL,17,FGeorge Oswald said "current financial
OL,18,Fchallenges" meant change was not
OL,19,Fcurrently being considered but the
OL,20,Fissue may be revisited "at some point"
OL,21,Fduring this political term.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
