OL,3,GNEWSAIVF funding may be revisited, says
OL,4,Ahealth official
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt present the government does fund
OL,7,Ffertility services including diagnostic
OL,8,Ftests, some medical interventions,
OL,9,Fprescriptions and travel costs for
OL,10,Ftreatment.
